1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 16=

2
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,600
Boss.

3
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,840
You know where to deliver the letter?

4
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,640
Yes.

5
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,180
Guaranteed Win Legal House
on Eastern Street.

6
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,040
Stay sharp. Don't let anyone spot you.

7
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,280
Got it.

8
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:38,880
Give me the bracelet.

9
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,600
You wretched woman!
Give me the bracelet!

10
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:44,880
- Boss!
- Are you all right?

11
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,560
Boss.

12
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:50,620
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

13
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:53,100
(Command)

14
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,080
Rousang.

15
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:06,680
Rousang!

16
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:14,850
(Your girl is in my hands.
If you want her alive,)

17
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,940
(bring 50 taels of silver to the old dyehouse
at Sanli Market, west of the city.)

18
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,520
Did you deliver the letter?

19
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,720
Yes, Boss.

20
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,710
We need to get out of here.

21
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,960
If we don't leave now,
it'll be too late.

22
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:39,800
What do you mean?

23
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,320
You don't know.

24
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,400
They're from the palace.

25
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,440
I saw palace insignias
hanging from their waists.

26
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:45,720
Insignias?

27
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,120
They're from the palace?

28
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,840
Boss, let's get out of here.

29
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,280
Wait.

30
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,640
That girl knows what we look like.

31
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,400
Once a Wanted Notice is issued,

32
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,640
none of us will get away.

33
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:05,360
Either way, we're as good as dead.

34
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,640
We might as well go all the way.

35
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,080
Get up.

36
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,760
Let her go.

37
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:28,240
Who are you?

38
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,040
Get lost!

39
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:36,990
Bring the money over.

40
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,720
Don't move! I'm warning you.

41
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:55,680
Don't move!

42
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,240
Or I'll kill her.

43
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,760
Are you all right?

44
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,000
Songpiao.

45
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,000
Where are you going?

46
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,160
Wait here for me.

47
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,040
Who hit her?

48
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,560
- We all did.
- We all hit her.

49
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,160
You're asking for death.

50
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:00,600
Boss!

51
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:03,880
Let's go.

52
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,320
Songpiao.

53
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,920
Give me the knife.

54
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,200
Let's go home.

55
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:52,960
Come on.

56
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,360
What could have made Sizhou so anxious?

57
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,520
Do you know?

58
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,920
I'll make it worth your while.

59
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,760
Tell me.

60
00:06:08,770 --> 00:06:09,920
When you were with Sizhou before,

61
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:12,040
did you hear anything unusual?

62
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,960
Just eating and not talking, huh?

63
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,040
And that woman named Hetao

64
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,200
kept avoiding the subject too.

65
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,840
Langjing.

66
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:24,840
Cheng Gui.

67
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,040
Xichun Pavilion.

68
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,520
Hetao.

69
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,760
Eating walnuts.

70
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,120
Six walnuts.

71
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:31,790
Walnuts are good for the brain.

72
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:34,800
My head's about to explode.

73
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,720
Miss Jiang.

74
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,500
Someone outside is asking for you.

75
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,440
Who?

76
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,760
Your Highness?

77
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,560
I didn't tell you to come back, did I?

78
00:06:59,160 --> 00:06:59,560
I...

79
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,560
This time, I hid in the ship's
hold on the way back.

80
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:03,320
Well,

81
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:05,200
no one else saw me.

82
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,640
Speak.

83
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,640
What's so urgent?

84
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,520
The First Prince, Sizhou,

85
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,280
and that legal advocate Jiang Xiaobai

86
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,640
went to Langjing Kingdom.

87
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,040
They're still looking for me.

88
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:20,760
Looking for you?

89
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,760
Then...

90
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,520
Did they discover you?

91
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:28,640
Well...

92
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,840
No.

93
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,720
They came out of nowhere

94
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,040
and then suddenly left.

95
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:34,600
Suddenly left?

96
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,560
What happened?

97
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:37,920
At the time,

98
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:40,040
there was a hostess named Hetao.

99
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,720
They specifically asked for her.

100
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,680
Then

101
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:45,000
it seemed they were trying
to find out where I was.

102
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:47,120
But Hetao didn't tell them anything.

103
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,880
And Hetao told me

104
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:49,760
that

105
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,600
after the First Prince
saw the tattoo on her body,

106
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,000
he was shocked

107
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,400
and left immediately.

108
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,520
A tattoo?

109
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:57,760
That's right.

110
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,600
What did it look like?

111
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,320
It's the design

112
00:08:00,330 --> 00:08:01,890
all the ladies of Xichun Pavilion have.

113
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,760
This one.

114
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,000
Go to Xichun Pavilion

115
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,120
and bring Hetao back.

116
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,900
You can handle that, can't you?

117
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,320
Yes, I can.

118
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,040
I just need to buy her freedom.

119
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,960
Then hurry up and go.

120
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,400
Understood.

121
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,200
Jingshu,

122
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,520
just how many secrets

123
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,400
are you still hiding?

124
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,000
Your Highness,

125
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,080
why did you ask to see me?

126
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:50,120
As a prince,

127
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:53,400
Sizhou can never marry
beneath his station.

128
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,520
If you truly love him,

129
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,400
you should put yourself in his position

130
00:08:57,410 --> 00:08:58,690
and consider things
from his perspective.

131
00:08:58,880 --> 00:08:59,920
instead of acting solely

132
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,440
on your own selfish desires

133
00:09:01,450 --> 00:09:03,310
and putting Sizhou
in an impossible position,

134
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,000
making him fail the entire realm.

135
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:09,020
(Xichun Pavilion)

136
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,120
As a prince,

137
00:09:11,130 --> 00:09:12,990
he should have the right
to choose for himself.

138
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,120
You're the one
who has no right to choose.

139
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,520
Understand?

140
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,600
Walnut.

141
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,560
Six walnuts.

142
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:27,440
Walnuts are good
for the brain. Walnuts...

143
00:09:39,020 --> 00:09:39,480
Quick!

144
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,760
Don't move!

145
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:41,920
Don't move!

146
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,160
Nobody move!

147
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:43,920
Don't move!

148
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,000
What's going on?

149
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,880
Sir, let's talk this over.

150
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,200
There's no need for trouble.

151
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,880
Where's the woman named Hetao?

152
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:53,840
Hetao?

153
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:54,280
Yes.

154
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:54,960
Tell me!

155
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,280
Early this morning,

156
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,600
that lover of hers,

157
00:09:58,920 --> 00:09:59,800
Cheng Gui,

158
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,960
came with a large sum of money
to buy her freedom.

159
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,600
I thought it was a lucrative deal.

160
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,080
But I never expected...

161
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,080
Speak.

162
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,840
That trouble would come knocking.

163
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,640
Sir, I found it.

164
00:10:19,700 --> 00:10:23,300
(Register)

165
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:28,700
(Hetao. Fifty taels. Age 42)

166
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,640
All provisions related to
the laws of Bojue

167
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,080
have been revised.

168
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,120
Advocate Jiang,

169
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:38,040
I have a question for you.

170
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,880
Go ahead.

171
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:41,040
What do you think of the women
of the pleasure houses

172
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:43,480
who are branded
as being of "lowly status"?

173
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:44,960
First of all, I don't accept

174
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,420
this so-called "lowly status" at all.

175
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,400
Why is it

176
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:50,630
that when a man pursues
many women, he's called charming,

177
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:52,340
but when a woman sells herself,
she's called lowly?

178
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,800
And I believe those
who should be questioned

179
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,280
aren't these women,

180
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,480
but the social realities
behind their circumstances.

181
00:10:58,900 --> 00:11:00,880
Why are respectable women
forced into prostitution?

182
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,960
Why is this the only path left to them?

183
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:05,480
What do you think?

184
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,480
Then I heard from the servants

185
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,040
that some time ago, you took Sizhou

186
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,560
to Xichun Pavilion.

187
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,440
Why was that?

188
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,280
I only wanted to investigate

189
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,660
the Imperial Retreat case further,

190
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,440
because I keep feeling

191
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,720
that the matter with Lu Cen

192
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,440
isn't as simple as it seems.

193
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:26,160
And my only lead is Cheng Gui.

194
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:28,440
The only place Cheng Gui
frequented was Xichun Pavilion.

195
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,360
I see.

196
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:31,960
By the way,

197
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,880
about what I asked of you some time ago,

198
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,560
have you given it any thought?

199
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,560
Sizhou is his own person.

200
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:42,240
He's free to choose
who he wants to be with.

201
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:44,580
Neither you nor I
have the right to interfere.

202
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,360
The work is finished.

203
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,120
It's time for me

204
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,000
to step down from office.

205
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,160
(Jiang Xiaobai.)

206
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,960
(This is the outcome
you chose for yourself.)

207
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:03,560
Cheng Gui,

208
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,680
when you bought my freedom,

209
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:07,840
didn't you say you'd
take me home to live with you?

210
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,800
Why did you bring me here?

211
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,880
Are you hiding something from me?

212
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,040
Actually...

213
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,320
Actually, this...

214
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,430
I was the one who asked Cheng Gui

215
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,760
to bring you here.

216
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,640
Sir.

217
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:24,360
There's no need to be afraid.

218
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:26,240
There's simply something

219
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,880
I'd like to ask for your help with.

220
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:32,800
From now on,

221
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:34,560
stay by her side at all times

222
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,110
and take good care of her.

223
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:37,840
Yes.

224
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,880
This way, please.

225
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:40,880
It's all right.

226
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,840
Sir has treated me well.

227
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:49,860
Since I'm already here,
I'll make the best of it.

228
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,000
Whatever you need me to do,

229
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,760
just say the word.

230
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:58,480
You certainly
are a straightforward woman.

231
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,560
Please.

232
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:02,960
Let's go.

233
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,360
From now on,

234
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,400
you and she must act separately

235
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,280
to avoid drawing attention.

236
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:13,560
Yes.

237
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,160
You may go.

238
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:46,680
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

239
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:50,040
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

240
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:52,440
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

241
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:55,360
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

242
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:00,240
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

243
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:03,920
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

244
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,080
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

245
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:09,560
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

246
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:15,200
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

247
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:18,800
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

248
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:21,840
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

249
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:25,880
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

250
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:29,160
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

251
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:32,240
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

252
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:34,960
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

253
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:38,200
♪I'll only say that once♪

254
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,440
♪I called your name♪

255
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:47,280
♪The silent stars hang low♪

256
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,880
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

257
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,040
♪I linger in the old tower♪

258
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:57,800
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

259
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:01,560
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

260
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:05,240
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

261
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,240
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

262
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:14,480
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

263
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:17,640
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

264
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:21,720
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

265
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:24,360
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

266
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:28,640
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

267
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:31,560
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

268
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,720
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

269
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:37,400
♪If we meet again in another life♪

270
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,440
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

271
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:43,400
♪Was when we first met?♪

272
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,080
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

273
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,960
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
